  "passages": [
    "Research areas of the Data Science and Engineering (DSE) bachelor degree. Research knowledge provided by the Data Science and Engineering Department: Web and Cloud Technology; Artificial Intelligence or Machine Learning; Big Data; Business Intelligence.",
