    "Evaluation and graduation in the Data Science and Engineering (DSE) bachelor degree. Assessment of study is performed at the end of each semester. Evaluation is shown as the Grade Point Average (GPA) on a 4.00 scale and the Cumulative Grade Point Average on a 4.00 scale.",
    "Grading scale of the Data Science and Engineering (DSE) bachelor degree (score range, GPA, grade): 85-100 = GPA 4.0 = A (Excellent); 80-84 = GPA 3.5 = B+ (Very Good); 70-79 = GPA 3.0 = B (Good); 65-69 = GPA 2.5 = C+ (Fairly Good); 50-64 = GPA 2.0 = C (Fair); 45-49 = GPA 1.5 = D (Poor); below 40 = GPA 0.0 = E (Fail).",
